{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spinwave Survivors is a fast-paced survival shooter with roguelike elements. Scoot, shoot and boost your way through hordes of drones as you upgrade your weapons and unlock new abilities, all while attempting the survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/f099243e8004d2f5549ac90ae716d6f7.poster.avif?t=1768735656\" width=622 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/f099243e8004d2f5549ac90ae716d6f7.webm?t=1768735656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/f099243e8004d2f5549ac90ae716d6f7.mp4?t=1768735656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement is key</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> around to avoid enemies, then set up the best angles to unleash a swarm of bullets at them, bonus points for taking down more in a combo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost</strong> through enemies to turn invincible and deal damage to enemies, kill enemies to recharge boost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/7c6f70be6bc709fd5f391713f7125be7.poster.avif?t=1768735656\" width=622 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/7c6f70be6bc709fd5f391713f7125be7.webm?t=1768735656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/7c6f70be6bc709fd5f391713f7125be7.mp4?t=1768735656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast paced runs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take on challenging but quick runs, designed to last around <strong>5 minutes</strong> and still give plenty of room for experimentation.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/46c7be4bfcd2fe523af314683d7fb3ae.poster.avif?t=1768735656\" width=622 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/46c7be4bfcd2fe523af314683d7fb3ae.webm?t=1768735656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/46c7be4bfcd2fe523af314683d7fb3ae.mp4?t=1768735656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and unlocks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your vehicle, weapons and abilities during a run to help you survive longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100</strong> passive and active upgrades, each with multiple levels to build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete  challenges</strong> to unlock new weapons, upgrades, maps and drivers, each with their own benefits and playstyles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/b9e2a7d19d02f5b29b7afb75